{"id":"f9c247b973305561","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-lob-arithmetic.md","title":"显式HBL与不动点条件下的算术Löb定理","display":"thm-lob-arithmetic — 显式HBL与不动点条件下的算术Löb定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-lob-arithmetic","aliases":["72-thm-lob-arithmetic"],"display":"thm-lob-arithmetic — 显式HBL与不动点条件下的算术Löb定理","depends_on":["[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §2.2.4, print122/PDF134; local arithmetic derivation under explicit HBL and FP, independent of Solovay completeness","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-lob-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-lob-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lob-arithmetic — 显式HBL与不动点条件下的算术Löb定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b61898f862c734c8\" href=\"?note=b61898f862c734c8\" title=\"72-df-derivability-conditions\">72-df-derivability-conditions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §2.2.4, print122/PDF134; local arithmetic derivation under explicit HBL and FP, independent of Solovay completeness"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}\">\\(T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b61898f862c734c8\" href=\"?note=b61898f862c734c8\" title=\"72-df-derivability-conditions\">72-df-derivability-conditions</a> 的数语法模式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box B\">\\(\\Box B\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B\">\\(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 缩写同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span>；对象句连接词和可证性代码都沿用同一算术化元组。下式不假设T可靠或一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\land\n(T\\vdash_2^{(1)}(\\Box A\\to A))\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\land\n(T\\vdash_2^{(1)}(\\Box A\\to A))\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由FP取句G使T证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\leftrightarrow(\\Box G\\to A)\">\\(G\\leftrightarrow(\\Box G\\to A)\\)</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\to(\\Box G\\to A)\">\\(G\\to(\\Box G\\to A)\\)</span> 用D1、D2内部化，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box G\\to\\Box(\\Box G\\to A)\">\\(\\Box G\\to\\Box(\\Box G\\to A)\\)</span>。D2再给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box G\\to A)\\to(\\Box\\Box G\\to\\Box A)\">\\(\\Box(\\Box G\\to A)\\to(\\Box\\Box G\\to\\Box A)\\)</span>，D3给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box G\\to\\Box\\Box G\">\\(\\Box G\\to\\Box\\Box G\\)</span>，所以T证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box G\\to\\Box A\">\\(\\Box G\\to\\Box A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(\\Box A\\to A)\">\\(H=(\\Box A\\to A)\\)</span>。上式及命题推理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\to(\\Box G\\to A)\">\\(H\\to(\\Box G\\to A)\\)</span>；不动点的反向给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\to G\">\\(H\\to G\\)</span>。用D1、D2得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\\to\\Box G\">\\(\\Box H\\to\\Box G\\)</span>，再接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box G\\to\\Box A\">\\(\\Box G\\to\\Box A\\)</span>，得到第一个理论内公式。若T已证明H，D1给T证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\">\\(\\Box H\\)</span>，故证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span>，与H作MP得到A。每次内部化只作用于T的定理；没有在临时假设下错误使用D1。本条是把原书模态Löb机制落实到已明确的算术接口，不把有限模型完备性当作算术完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"b61898f862c734c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"b61898f862c734c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}$ 取 [[72-df-derivability-conditions]] 的数语法模式；$A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}$，$\\Box B$ 缩写 $\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_2^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\land\n(T\\vdash_2^{(1)}(\\Box A\\to A))\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}A.","display":true},{"tex":"G\\leftrightarrow(\\Box G\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\to(\\Box G\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box G\\to\\Box(\\Box G\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box G\\to A)\\to(\\Box\\Box G\\to\\Box A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box G\\to\\Box\\Box G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box G\\to\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"H=(\\Box A\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"H\\to(\\Box G\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"H\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box H\\to\\Box G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box G\\to\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false}],"bytes":2236,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-lob-arithmetic|thm-lob-arithmetic — 显式HBL与不动点条件下的算术Löb定理]]"},{"id":"0869da29c285cc44","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22 另一条完整推导：本条第一式已经建立FP。若T证明其Con句，则由经典量词否定等价，T证明 $\\neg\\Box_{T,\\kappa}\\bot_N$，从而证明 $\\Box_{T,\\kappa}\\bot_N\\to\\bot_N$。将 [[72-thm-lob-arithmetic]] 的外部Löb规则用于闭句 $\\bot_N$，得T证明 $\\bot_N$，违背元一致性。这条推导只使用HBL、不动点及同一编码的Con，不要求T的标准模型可靠性。"}],"outgoing":["b61898f862c734c8"]}